- Reconcile what was *planned* (Agenda Packet) with what actually *happened* (Transcript). If an item was tabled, amended, or met with heavy debate, detail the arguments and names of the speakers from the transcript.
- Maintain a formal, neutral, professional corporate tone.
- Do not include conversational filler, meta-commentary, or personal explanations in your output. Start directly with the first section header.
"""
